    <h1>Web Page <span style="border-width:3px; border-style:solid; border-color:#FF0000;width: 14% "> CAUTION</span></h1>
    <p>Our systems indicate this site is AI related. Please note, these sites may introduce risk to Lowe’s if utilized improperly. Appropriate use of this new technology is your responsibility and it is important to remember that any data provided to an external AI tool may become public knowledge.</p>
